WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.980
[MUSIC]

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:12.297
Particularly in our industry,
there hasn't been a lot of big disruptive

00:00:12.297 --> 00:00:15.721
innovation happening on the back
end on the supply chain.

00:00:15.721 --> 00:00:18.173
[MUSIC]

00:00:18.173 --> 00:00:20.851
We just think that the industry
is in the paradigm of

00:00:20.851 --> 00:00:24.607
more mindlessly producing than what
consumers actually really want.

00:00:24.607 --> 00:00:34.270
[MUSIC]

00:00:34.270 --> 00:00:34.908
&gt;&gt; Come on in.

00:00:34.908 --> 00:00:35.628
&gt;&gt; Thanks.

00:00:35.628 --> 00:00:39.504
&gt;&gt; So this is a 3D body scanner.

00:00:39.504 --> 00:00:44.487
[SOUND]

00:00:44.487 --> 00:00:47.330
[MUSIC]

00:00:47.330 --> 00:00:52.020
We have begun experimenting with new
technologies to create colors without

00:00:52.020 --> 00:00:54.227
using water and chemical for sure.

00:00:54.227 --> 00:00:59.032
[MUSIC]

00:00:59.032 --> 00:01:00.094
We have materials like this.

00:01:00.094 --> 00:01:02.199
That's really sustainable.

00:01:02.199 --> 00:01:05.586
The white dots are actually
upcycled denim.

00:01:05.586 --> 00:01:15.661
[MUSIC]

00:01:15.661 --> 00:01:19.174
It creates a very tangible excitement,
I think,

00:01:19.174 --> 00:01:23.031
when consumers can actually
put fitting products on.

00:01:23.031 --> 00:01:28.319
We just recognize that the trifecta
of fashion, technology,

00:01:28.319 --> 00:01:32.721
and business are all essential and
complimentary.

00:01:32.721 --> 00:01:36.520
[MUSIC]

00:01:36.520 --> 00:01:39.980
We as startups play
a unique role in society.

00:01:39.980 --> 00:01:44.890
If we can't inspire change, bigger, slower
companies that have a lot of approval and

00:01:44.890 --> 00:01:48.806
compliance processes would not even
start to think about changing.

00:01:48.806 --> 00:01:52.002
So we play a very unique role
in pushing the envelope.

00:01:52.002 --> 00:02:02.002
[MUSIC]

